Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha!

247
00:20:48,790 --> 00:20:50,870
Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha!

248
00:20:50,870 --> 00:20:52,930
I can't believe you pulled it off!

249
00:20:52,930 --> 00:20:55,630
Seems I chose the right side after all.

250
00:20:55,630 --> 00:20:57,930
Though seeing as I was getting tortured every day,

251
00:20:57,930 --> 00:21:00,610
I didn't have anywhere to go but up.

252
00:21:00,610 --> 00:21:02,770
Moroon!

253
00:21:02,770 --> 00:21:05,310
He stole that power from Pops!

254
00:21:05,310 --> 00:21:06,670
I know, but how?

255
00:21:06,670 --> 00:21:08,170
That isn't normal, is it?

256
00:21:11,050 --> 00:21:14,350
A hand of darkness to call forth the void.

257
00:21:14,350 --> 00:21:17,990
A hand of light to shake the heavens and rend the earth.

258
00:21:17,990 --> 00:21:22,930
Both are mine, and the world will tremble with my every step.

259
00:21:22,930 --> 00:21:26,430
Only a fool would dare defy me!

260
00:21:29,430 --> 00:21:31,930
I don't know how he did it, but he did it!

261
00:21:31,930 --> 00:21:34,550
You can't fake having a power like that!

262
00:21:34,550 --> 00:21:36,270
But does he know that we don't?

263
00:21:36,270 --> 00:21:37,270
Sam!

264
00:21:37,270 --> 00:21:39,850
We beat Whitebeard, but so what?

265
00:21:39,850 --> 00:21:41,890
It's even worse than before!

266
00:21:41,890 --> 00:21:42,810
But hold on.

267
00:21:42,810 --> 00:21:45,010
I thought if you tried to get a second devil fruit power,

268
00:21:45,010 --> 00:21:47,430
then your body would, like, blow up.

269
00:21:47,430 --> 00:21:50,590
Yeah, for normal people, that's how it works.

270
00:21:50,590 --> 00:21:52,090
But you know as well as I do

271
00:21:52,090 --> 00:21:54,430
that teaches anything but normal.

272
00:21:54,430 --> 00:21:55,970
And with that body of his,

273
00:21:55,970 --> 00:21:59,630
he can pull a trick we couldn't even dream of.

274
00:21:59,630 --> 00:22:02,530
He's probably been planning this thing for ages now.

275
00:22:02,530 --> 00:22:04,630
Got your attention now, Z-

276
00:22:04,630 --> 00:22:06,530
Ha ha ha ha ha!

277
00:22:06,530 --> 00:22:09,770
This is a wake-up call to all the boring peace lovers,

278
00:22:09,770 --> 00:22:11,370
the half-assed pirates,

279
00:22:11,370 --> 00:22:14,170
the fat-headed fools in world government,

280
00:22:14,170 --> 00:22:16,510
the ignorant masses!

281
00:22:16,510 --> 00:22:17,510
This is a nightmare.

282
00:22:17,510 --> 00:22:19,050
It just has to be.

283
00:22:19,050 --> 00:22:21,710
We all must answer to the hand of fate.

284
00:22:21,710 --> 00:22:22,550
Z-

285
00:22:22,550 --> 00:22:24,610
Ha ha ha ha ha ha!

286
00:22:24,610 --> 00:22:29,510
And fate has chosen me to conquer this world!

287
00:22:29,510 --> 00:22:31,850
This isn't fair.

288
00:22:31,850 --> 00:22:32,850
This isn't fair.

289
00:22:32,850 --> 00:22:33,850
The Navy won.

290
00:22:33,850 --> 00:22:35,850
Roger's son is dead and so is Whitebeard.

291
00:22:35,850 --> 00:22:36,850
We're all doomed.

292
00:22:36,850 --> 00:22:39,850
Even the Admirals can't fight someone like that.

293
00:22:39,850 --> 00:22:40,850
He's a monster!

294
00:22:40,850 --> 00:22:42,850
A demon!

295
00:22:42,850 --> 00:22:43,850
Damn it!

296
00:22:43,850 --> 00:22:45,850
I thought this war was over already.

297
00:22:45,850 --> 00:22:47,390
How many people have to die

298
00:22:47,390 --> 00:22:49,970
before we can stop these pirates for good?

299
00:22:49,970 --> 00:22:52,970
I told myself this execution was a necessary evil,

300
00:22:52,970 --> 00:22:53,930
but after all this,

301
00:22:53,930 --> 00:22:56,670
we're even worse off than when we started.

302
00:22:56,670 --> 00:22:59,670
Z-

303
00:22:59,670 --> 00:23:00,670
Ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha!

304
00:23:00,670 --> 00:23:01,670
Yeah!

305
00:23:01,670 --> 00:23:04,670
Ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha!

306
00:23:11,550 --> 00:23:14,050
Having stolen Whitebeard's devil-proof power,

307
00:23:14,050 --> 00:23:16,590
Blackbeard rampages to his heart's content.

308
00:23:16,590 --> 00:23:18,450
Meanwhile, Aka-Inu and the Navy

309
00:23:18,450 --> 00:23:21,170
massacre the pirates in the name of justice.

310
00:23:21,170 --> 00:23:23,370
As the battlefield becomes a living nightmare,

311
00:23:23,370 --> 00:23:25,430
Kobe stares on in horror,

312
00:23:25,430 --> 00:23:27,230
voices echoing in his head.

313
00:23:27,230 --> 00:23:29,130
On the next One Piece,

314
00:23:29,130 --> 00:23:31,230
the insatiable Aka-Inu,

315
00:23:31,230 --> 00:23:33,310
Lava Fist Pummel Luffy,

316
00:23:33,310 --> 00:23:35,510
I'm gonna be king of the pirates!

